{
  "id": "63",
  "title": "渊源集说",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“渊源集说”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "最贵者，官星为命，时得偏正财为福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-c80e6c84598d50512fcb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "最凶者，七杀临身，逢天月二德为祥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-04bfc3da5bc0564d02e4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星若遇劫财，虽官无贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-9275d39fd8c6e2c0b208-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀如逢资助，其杀愈重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-524b45a24ce62e1ece37-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三合六合，运至逢而必荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-d3f29a13623a0d0e02e5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七官八官，月逢官而为喜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-ab710f5181182128548f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四合四刑，合刑当为偏正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-39031d764d0ccd4449a2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七冲七击，冲击喜得会藏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-e275b052f50b2e2623b2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夹贵夹丘为暗会。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-380fdf9b91ac76d94caa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财库官库要正冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-863d543157dcfb099290-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星在生旺之方，逢则何须发见。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-e3e76aaa68860ac0ef24-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬临孟仲之下，见而不见。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-9995f440ae288af836c5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "露形印綬，得劫财为贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-2d90314a93d4e291ff72-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财源喜伤（伤官），贵为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-0ae7f1e7d0557b6e99aa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官要见印綬，贵不可言。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-7edc576419b207e69ca4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "归禄若见子孙（食神），禄无限妙。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-75a8dc1863df8bbeb54b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年月立有阴阳阳刃，刑罚重犯。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-b9e36ba5598ace460dab-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀混逢天月德，寿位高迁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-3620de9a4eed27400f2c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "飞刃伏刃，会刃多凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-94db14af9d0baf6a6a8c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，剥官见祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-7986a7507d3784ba7cca-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃若逢印綬，纵贵，有病疾在身。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-9b168245b39cfe474169-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀并制，逢官为祸，而寿元不长。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-46c20d84d5115b05462c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三偏三正，贵居一品之尊。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-f78484f4e2860b42fb13-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱四合，福坐众人之上。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-3e4ea868afd012ab2658-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀化为印，早擢登科。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-539fb0b289407a7709a3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺生官，少年承业。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-2c980d127917698b66e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀同来，要知扶官扶杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-58adfe96f082dbd195a9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏正会合，须知合正合偏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-945ecea60d96f8256fac-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "福禄若逢阳刃，世事不明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-cfd6904575f7874a8fc2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神运入水乡，身衰夭折。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-cc65660ed28835aeba86-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "暗中藏杀，须凭月下刑神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-7fa96c3b0930ee5f584b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见处无财，必受空中祸患。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-49d9a243367c5f85c3b0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃兼会七杀，千里徒流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-72dd923a8cc059f4450c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用财若遇劫夺，一生贫困。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-21ccf707dc65ae400609-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "人生前定，穷富已明，如要识其消长，亦多究其始终；或有前贫后富、或有骤发卒倾、或有白屋之公卿、或有朱门之饿殍、或一生长乐、或一生失所，当视流运之源，要察行年之位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-131bc80f5ab4421aa62a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱徒然入格，纵发早亡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-6fd80a7695f842fb871a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "福转若遇休囚，卒发倾夭。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-1020fa9491dc51d60817-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以，用神不可妄求，形踪自然发见，有福必当用彼，无时必是用身，祸患在于五行，福崇在于运气；福源人所同具，如或伤终困此中。消息阴阳，在我通明理智，荣辱两端，媸妍一断。自古相传，非贤勿授。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "63-e22adba02b9027df3bad-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
